<title>USA: Mego Mortgage gets $40 mln credit facility.</title>
<headline>Mego Mortgage gets $40 mln credit facility.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mego Mortgage Corp said Wednesday it had arranged a $40 million revolving credit facility with First National Bank of Chicago.</p>
<p>The company said the facility may be renewed on an annual basis and bears interest based either on a margin over LIBOR or the federal funds funding rate.</p>
<p>The facility will be secured by loans prior to sale, and is expandable to $90 million at the option of the company with commitments from additional participating lenders.</p>
</text>
